]

### 2. 根据功能ID列表删除多语言数据
DELETE {{prefix}}/test/functionTl/deleteTl?functionIds=1001,1002,1003
X-Project-Code: {{projectCode}}
Authorization: {{authToken}}

### 3. 根据功能ID列表查询多语言数据
GET {{prefix}}/test/functionTl/findByFunctionIds?functionIdList=1001,1002,1003
X-Project-Code: {{projectCode}}
Authorization: {{authToken}}